  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Red Cross Center-HRFT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xF6;da Korsets Center-HRFT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Behandlings- och rehabiliteringsprojektets m&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att erbjuda behandling, rehabilitering och socialt st&#xF6;d till tortyr&#xF6;verlevande och deras anh&#xF6;riga men ocks&#xE5; att &#xF6;ka medvetenheten om m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter och f&#xF6;rekomsten av tortyr i landet. Parterna, Human Rights Foundation of Turkey och Svenska R&#xF6;da Korsets Center f&#xF6;r Torterade Flyktingar, har samarbetat sedan 1992 med svenskt st&#xF6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to offer treatment of, rehabilitation of and social support to people who survived torture and to their families. Another objective is to increase the public awareness of human rights and the extensive use of torture in the country. The Human Rights Foundation of Turkey and the Swedish Red Cross/Red Cross Center for Tortured Refugees have cooperated since 1992 with Swedish support.</narrative>
  </description>
